 "meta_description": "A one-month Bolna Voice AI pilot with a dedicated POC, weekly 1:1 calls and 25 concurrent calls. Plans from $300 for 6,500 minutes.",
 "text": "How it Works\nFeatures\nIntegrations\nAgents\nCase Studies\nPricing\nNews\nDocs\nCareers\nLogin\nBook a Demo\nPILOT PROGRAM\nGuided support to help you scale\n\nA one-month pilot with a dedicated POC, weekly 1:1 calls and 25 concurrent calls. Pick the plan that fits your volume.\n\nFOR NEW USERS ONLY \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 ONE-TIME RECHARGE \u00a0\u00b7\u00a0 30 DAYS\nPILOT \u00b7 6,500 MIN\n$300\n$350\n14% savings vs the standard rate\nMINUTES\n6,500\nPER MINUTE\n~4.6\u00a2\nCONCURRENCY\n25\nPriority support via WhatsApp\nWeekly calls with a Success Manager\nEarly access to beta features\nSubaccount features enabled\nHelp with setup, integrations, and prompting guides\nBuy a pilot\nPILOT \u00b7 12,000 MIN\nRECOMMENDED\n$500\n$600\n17% savings vs the standard rate\nMINUTES\n12,000\nPER MINUTE\n~4.2\u00a2\nCONCURRENCY\n25\nPriority support via WhatsApp\nWeekly calls with a Success Manager\nEarly access to beta features\nSubaccount features enabled\nHelp with setup, integrations, and prompting guides\nInitial agent configuration\nBuy a pilot\nOne-time recharge, secured by Stripe. Read the full Pilot Program terms.\nWHAT YOU GET\nSupport built to help you scale\nDedicated WhatsApp group\n\nA group with your dedicated POC and priority support, so questions get answered where your team already works.\n\nWeekly 1:1 calls\n\nA standing call with your POC to review calls, tighten prompts and decide what to build next.\n\nMax concurrency of 25\n\nRun parallel and batch calling from day one, with up to 25 calls at once.\n\nSetup and integrations\n\nHands-on help with agent setup, APIs and the integrations your use case depends on.\n\nSubaccount features\n\nSubaccount features are enabled on your account for the length of the pilot.\n\nFixed per-minute pricing\n\nA predictable cost per minute with Bolna recommended models, so you can budget before you scale.\n\nHOW IT WORKS\nFrom payment to production in four steps\n01\nBuy your pilot\n\nCreate an account on the platform, open Add Funds, and choose a plan from the Pilots tab.\n\n02\nMeet your POC\n\nYour WhatsApp group opens and your first 1:1 call gets booked with your dedicated POC.\n\n03\nBuild and test\n\nCreate your first agent with Auto Build in under 10 minutes, then run test calls and refine.\n\n04\nGo live and scale\n\nRun batch calls, review results in your weekly 1:1, and plan what comes after the pilot.\n\nReady to put a voice agent on real calls?\n\nStart with a pilot and get guided support as you scale.\n\nBuy a pilot\nBook a Demo\nAPI Documentation\nAPI authentication\nUsing Agents APIs\nMaking phone calls APIs\nGet call data APIs\nPhone numbers APIs\nInbound agents APIs\nKnowledgebases APIs\nBatch APIs\nSub account APIs\nSIP Trunk APIs\nDispositions APIs\nProduct\nDashboard\nFunction tool calling\nPDFs, RAGs & Knowledge bases\nUsing Twilio with Bolna Voice agents\nUsing Plivo with Bolna Voice agents\nUsing Vobiz with Bolna Voice agents\nMultilingual support\nMaking bulk calls & campaigns\nAI outbound calling\nAgent library & templates\nBolna Voice agent integrations\nAI voice agents\nAI voice agent platform\nHindi text to speech\nAgent Studio\nBeta Community\nBeta Community Terms\nBolna Builders Community Showcase\nBolna Builders Slack Community\nCompany\nYC Launch\nContact us\nSchedule a Call\nPartners Program\nPricing & Plans\nBolna CLI\nBolna Blogs\nNews & Updates\nLLMs.txt\nDocs LLMs.txt\nTop Indian AI Voice Agents\nSystem status\n\u00a9 2026 Whismurwave Inc. All Rights Reserved.\nTerms of use\nPrivacy Policy",
